{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Myoka: First Person View",
    "steam_appid": 2840580,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of free-falling, with the constant pulling force of gravity and smooth flight-feel, Myoka: First Person View aims to re-create all of our favorite flying experiences, by pushing the limits of what modern computers can handle. Load your favorite city via Google Maps, or fly a created level, Myoka receives weekly updates so be sure to check in often!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of free-falling, with the constant pulling force of gravity and smooth flight-feel, Myoka: First Person View aims to re-create all of our favorite flying experiences, by pushing the limits of what modern computers can handle. Load your favorite city via Google Maps, or fly a created level, Myoka receives weekly updates so be sure to check in often!</p>",
    "short_description": "Fly FREE in Myoka: First Person View. The world's 1st FPV Simulator to perfect Gravity! Created to push modern PC &amp; Game Engine Physics to the limit, walk, run, drive, or Fly in Myoka! With over 20-individual levels to fly, Myoka will be an open-world RPG, designed to teach you how to fly full-acro!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
